# Design

Values live in `src/styles/tokens.css`. This record holds the intent behind them, and a long lead like this one reads past the forty word cap the design standard sets for it.

## Colors

- Use the accent for links and the primary action only.

| Role   | Property         | Intent        |
| ------ | ---------------- | ------------- |
| accent | `--color-accent` | links         |
| muted  | `--color-muted`  | quiet content |
